[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11705.67, "timestamp": "03:15:05", "text": "哦。请解除对我的封禁。等等，发生了什么事？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11708.03, "timestamp": "03:15:08", "text": "你被封禁了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11712.349, "timestamp": "03:15:12", "text": "什么？你为此做了什么？我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11714.04, "timestamp": "03:15:14", "text": "我是 等待"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11720.55, "timestamp": "03:15:20", "text": "退出了游戏。她做了吗？她做了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11722.51, "timestamp": "03:15:22", "text": "实际上等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11725.309, "timestamp": "03:15:25", "text": "什么？哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11728.19, "timestamp": "03:15:28", "text": "不。呃，好的。这是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11736.15, "timestamp": "03:15:36", "text": "这？为什么会发出像光一样的光芒？呃，是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11739.19, "timestamp": "03:15:39", "text": "阴影是从这里来的吗？好的。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11742.79, "timestamp": "03:15:42", "text": "我来这里是为了寻找灵感。现在，我该怎么做？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11745.91, "timestamp": "03:15:45", "text": "我该怎么做？哦，我可以做桌子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11749.389, "timestamp": "03:15:49", "text": "像这样。哦，桌子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11756.79, "timestamp": "03:15:56", "text": "这？哦，这里还有更多东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11759.55, "timestamp": "03:15:59", "text": "尼科尔，什么是"}]